    <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_000476"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Biodiversity</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The species richness or diversity (such as the Shannon or Simpsons index) of a community of organisms within the experimental field. Whether the group of organsims is beneficial, neutral or detrimental to production should be unclear or mixed. One typically reported measure of biodiversity is microbial biomass.</skos:definition>
