    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">cage system</skos:altLabel>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">closed housing system including building construction and cage design and placement. The cages can be assembled together. Structure on concrete, wood, etc... with natural light or windowless with a light system, thermally insulated and ventilated or constructed with open sidewalls (windows with jalousie-type curtains)</skos:definition>
