    <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">Pennisetum inclusum</skos:altLabel>
    <era:conceptType>legacy_aom_concept</era:conceptType>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Kikuyu (Pennisetum clandestinum Hochst. ex Chiov) is a tropical grass from Eastern Africa that has been introduced in other tropical and subtropical areas. It is palatable, resistant to heavy grazing and mostly used for pasture. [Feedipedia]</skos:definition>
