  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/era-aom/livestock/AOM_000035">
    <skos:notation>AOM_000035</skos:notation>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The term shellfish is used both broadly and specifically. For regulatory purposes it is often narrowly defined as filter-feeding molluscs such as clams, mussels, and oyster to the exclusion of crustaceans and all else. Although their shells may differ, all shellfish are invertebrates.</skos:definition>
