    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Non-forage feeds rich in energy and protein. Concentrates include feeds such as maize bran, cotton seed cake, molasses, fish meal and bean cake. Non-forage feeds may use energy or protein rich part plants such as Seed,  whereas forage feeds are mainly plant leaves and stems.</skos:definition>
